@praneeshkhanna As much as I'd like to reply to these types of comments during a sector crash, I'm not in a position to tell anyone how to trade, how to position their portfolios, or when to sell. 

Everyone has their own risk profile. Some do indexes with 10% allocated to high-beta, others run more concentrated portfolios.  

In terms of my own portfolio, I'm long and can tolerate volatility. I reduced exposure earlier from 1.3x margin -> 90% long 10% cash, not using any leverage.

